    "summary": "Mortarion can use Inflamed Reprisal in the opposing Shooting phase when an enemy attacks one DEATH GUARD unit no farther than 6″ from him. Once the attacker is done, its target can return fire under your own Shooting phase rules. Worsen its Ballistic Skill by 1 for the return fire. The attacker is its sole permitted target and must be eligible for its shots.",
